<title>FINLAND: Neste 1996 sales, op profit by division.</title>
<headline>Neste 1996 sales, op profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy on Friday gave the following net sales and operating profit breakdown by division (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES				     1996	    1995</p>
<p> Oil					   35,844	  35,185</p>
<p> Exploration and production	     1,229	     822</p>
<p> Energy					 3,280	   2,831</p>
<p> Chemicals				    4,442	   5,245</p>
<p> Others					   511	     502</p>
<p> Internal sales			    -1,931	  -1,250</p>
<p> TOTAL					 43,375	  43,335 </p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT			    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Oil						196	     940</p>
<p> Exploration and production		 459	     179</p>
<p> Energy					   350	     324</p>
<p> Chemicals					332	     582</p>
<p> Associated companies			 -18	     419</p>
<p> Others					  -242	    -300</p>
<p> Eliminations				     1		-2</p>
<p> TOTAL					  1,078	   2,142</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
